SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "TCC.tcc_cr_class10a_carport_garage_front", "instrument_version": "TCC_CITY_PLAN_2014@2025-12-08", "topic": "SETBACK.FRONTAGE", "title": "Table 6.2.5.3 PO9 / AO9(a)", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_FRONT", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "class10a_street_setback >= main_building_street_setback", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2025-12-08", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "TOWNSVILLE"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "TCC:CHARACTER_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_10A", "CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "tcc_cr_class10a_carport_garage_front", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"min_street_setback_class10a_relative_to_main_building\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"applies to assessable development only (building work made code assessable by Table 5.7.1, e.g. a class 10a building in front of or within 3m of the facade facing any street)\", \"setback from the street >= the main building’s street setback\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": \"class10a_street_setback >= main_building_street_setback\"}\nStructure scope 'Class 10a structures such as carports, garages' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A', 'CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES - Table 6.2.5.3 editor’s note: \"This code contains alternative provisions for dwelling houses and dual occupancies to those set out in the Queensland Development Code (MP 1.1, MP 1.2 and MP 1.3), for the purposes of section 33 of the Building Act 1975.\"; Part 1 Table 1.6.1 lists the Character Residential Zone as \"Building assessment provisions – regulated building work in accordance with sections 32 and 33 of the Building Act 1975\"\nResearcher notes: Text-extractable PDF (pdftotext). AO9 items (b)-(g) (width, door, detached form, roof pitch, height, materials) omitted as out of scope. Only reached when the building work is code assessable under Table 5.7.1 (Character residential zone); class 10a work behind the 3m-from-facade line is accepted development with no benchmarks, so the QDC applies there."}$q$::jsonb);
