SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "TCC.tcc_rural_cungulla_front", "instrument_version": "TCC_CITY_PLAN_2014@2025-12-08", "topic": "SETBACK.FRONTAGE", "title": "Table 6.6.1.3 PO3 / AO3.2", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "PLANNING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_FRONT", "operator": ">=", "value": 6, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2025-12-08", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "TOWNSVILLE"}, {"level": "PRECINCT", "precinct": "TCC:RURAL/CUNGULLA"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "tcc_rural_cungulla_front", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"min_front_boundary_setback\", \"operator\": \">=\", \"value\": 6, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"Cungulla precinct only\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'dwellings and ancillary structures' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO - Part 1 Table 1.6.1 identifies only the Character residential zone code as s33 building assessment provisions; AO3.2 is a requirement for accepted development (material change of use) under Table 5.5.21\nResearcher notes: Requirement for a dwelling house that is accepted development subject to requirements in the Rural zone (Table 5.5.21). Whether it binds a later stand-alone Class 10a outbuilding (building work only, no MCU) is unclear; \"ancillary structures\" clearly includes sheds/carports."}$q$::jsonb);
